Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 11:30:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix problem module bugs (list route, slug handling, CORS,
 startup)

- GET /api/problem: service referenced undefined userId (ReferenceError -> 500);
  now lists published, non-deleted problems for learners
- Normalize slug (trim + lowercase) on update and delete
- Reject duplicate slugs at submission time with 409 (new slugTaken repo)
- Make slug uniqueness a partial index so soft-deleted slugs can be reused
- Enable CORS with credentials; await DB connection before listen
- Add Node engines field (>=22.18) since .ts files are imported directly
- Make eligibleChecker "user not found" message generic

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
